|         |                |                |           |
|   reads/writes      reads on start     cites          |
|         |                |                |           |
|  +------v------+  +-----v---------+  +---v--------+  |
|  | .idstack/   |  | .idstack/     |  | evidence/  |  |
|  | project.json|  | timeline.jsonl|  | references |  |
|  | (manifest)  |  | learnings.jsonl  | (T1-T5)    |  |
|  +-------------+  +---------------+  +------------+  |
|                               